menu "WVC sensor-node test hooks"

    config WVC_OTA_ROLLBACK_TEST_IMAGE
        bool "Build deterministic OTA rollback test image"
        default n
        help
            Test-only hook for hardware validation of ESP-IDF A/B rollback.
            When enabled, a freshly installed OTA image which is running in
            ESP_OTA_IMG_PENDING_VERIFY state performs a controlled restart
            before the normal health-confirmation window can complete.
            The bootloader must then roll back to the previous valid image.

            Keep this disabled for every normal/production firmware build.

endmenu
